bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Host:[/b] Welcome to the Tri City weekly podcast! This week, we have special guest, Georgia Waggner, to discuss the latest rumors about a werewolf hunting on the TriFang University Campus.

Georgia is a popular local personality and a successful business owner. So, tell us Ms. Waggner, what do you make of all this?

[i](time skip)[/i]

[b]Georgia:[/b] Gotta say, these rumors are really overblown. While it might be true that something nefarious has been sighted on the campus, I think it's more likely a vampire.

[b]Host:[/b] What about that lycanthropy professor? She seemed pretty convinced about the danger.

[b]Georgia:[/b] Lycanthropy? What does that even mean? We’re talking about werewolves here. I don’t care what some ivory tower snob says – I have common sense.

[b]Host:[/b] There you have it! Local business owner Georgia Wagger says there’s no werewolves, but there might be a vampire. Now, for a word from our sponsor, Garlic Emporium."
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

